IIPImage Server — OpenJPEG + Grok Public Build
================================================

This repository is a modified fork of IIPImage Server (iipsrv), combined at
build time with the Grok JPEG2000 codec. The combination, as a whole, is
distributed to you under the terms of the GNU Affero General Public License
version 3 (AGPLv3), because it links/includes AGPLv3-licensed code (Grok).

